    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1872520/extras/285a6bcff8dbb4bf5c30dae53df62ef7.poster.avif?t=1649760055\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1872520/extras/285a6bcff8dbb4bf5c30dae53df62ef7.webm?t=1649760055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1872520/extras/285a6bcff8dbb4bf5c30dae53df62ef7.mp4?t=1649760055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>                                                                                                     <i>I cannot die. I am very tired.</i><br><br>Hum is a game for fans of<strong> horror</strong> and<strong> adventure</strong> games with elements of stealth, taking a non-obvious inspiration from such classics as Flashback, Sanitarium, or Lone Survivor. It's ideal for the admirers of<strong> weirdness</strong> that mutates the body and twists the mind!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1872520/extras/7b8de32020515cfa76c5cf967fb974d8.poster.avif?t=1649760055\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1872520/extras/7b8de32020515cfa76c5cf967fb974d8.webm?t=1649760055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1872520/extras/7b8de32020515cfa76c5cf967fb974d8.mp4?t=1649760055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>This is a dark tale of a <strong>dystopian</strong>, retro land called Postapoland, from which there is no escape. Your task is to leave this cursed world full of contradictions and<strong> twisted mutants</strong>. The whole nightmare of the situation lies in the fact that the protagonist is unable to die once and for all. This is a game for an adult audience, inquisitive and fond of <strong>dark entertainment</strong>, who appreciates polished graphics and sound. Classic pixel-art is combined with hand-drawn masses of <strong>twisted meat, metal and plastic</strong>. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1872520/extras/25524cd13a61f22c6a09216f800df318.poster.avif?t=1649760055\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1872520/extras/25524cd13a61f22c6a09216f800df318.webm?t=1649760055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1872520/extras/25524cd13a61f22c6a09216f800df318.mp4?t=1649760055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Explore mysterious locations, talk to <strong>grotesque characters</strong> and hide from tracking machines and biomutants. Admire a brutalist-organic world where horror meets splendor! Find the source of the world's primordial hum, try to discover the most horrible truth about this reality and die once and for all - or look for a way to escape this land.<br><br>Make use of the <strong>death mechanics</strong> - in order to push the plot forward, the protagonist must die and be reborn, discovering that he has found himself in an unbreakable time loop.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1872520/extras/f2a44bcd792eec887132c326c932521c.poster.avif?t=1649760055\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1872520/extras/f2a44bcd792eec887132c326c932521c.webm?t=1649760055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1872520/extras/f2a44bcd792eec887132c326c932521c.mp4?t=1649760055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>You will learn the lore of the &quot;Hum&quot; world by <strong>solving puzzles</strong> and hearing the monologues and dialogues of<strong> half-crazed characters</strong>. You will be surprised by sudden changes of perspective and non-obvious gameplay.<br><br>The music you hear in the game is a dark soundtrack composed of mutant synthpop, early industrial music and distorted techno. It was created by Mchy i Porosty, a music project that can be heard on the soundtrack in <strong>Cyberpunk 2077</strong>.",
