9760055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>You will learn the lore of the &quot;Hum&quot; world by <strong>solving puzzles</strong> and hearing the monologues and dialogues of<strong> half-crazed characters</strong>. You will be surprised by sudden changes of perspective and non-obvious gameplay.<br><br>The music you hear in the game is a dark soundtrack composed of mutant synthpop, early industrial music and distorted techno. It was created by Mchy i Porosty, a music project that can be heard on the soundtrack in <strong>Cyberpunk 2077</strong>.",
